# skills.txt — User-defined skills and behaviors for Nyxo Code
# Place this file as:
#   ./skills.txt          (project-specific, loaded from CWD)
#   ~/.nyxo/skills.txt    (global fallback)
#
# The AI reads this on EVERY message. Write anything you want it to always do.
# Examples:

Always reply in a concise, direct style. No filler words.
When writing code, always include error handling.
Prefer TypeScript over JavaScript when creating new files.
Always run tests after making changes.
My project uses pnpm, not npm or yarn.
